sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Platform
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Manager as Manager Process
    participant APIServer as OpenShift APIServer<br/>TLS Profile
    participant DSC as trustyai-dsc-config<br/>ConfigMap
    participant OTel as OpenTelemetry Collector<br/>OTLP gRPC/HTTP

    Note over Manager: Startup & Configuration
    Manager->>APIServer: Read TLS profile (10s timeout)
    APIServer-->>Manager: TLS cipher suites + ALPN config
    Note over Manager: Falls back to intermediate<br/>ciphers on non-OpenShift
    Manager->>DSC: Read eval security policies
    DSC-->>Manager: permitOnline, permitCodeExecution
    Manager->>Manager: Register all reconciler controllers<br/>Configure metrics server auth

    Note over User,OTel: TrustyAI Service Lifecycle
    User->>K8sAPI: Create TrustyAIService CR
    K8sAPI-->>Manager: Watch notification
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Create Deployment<br/>(TrustyAI + kube-rbac-proxy sidecar)
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Create Secret (TLS cert)
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Create ClusterIP Service<br/>(443→8443 TLS)
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Create Route / VirtualService
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Create RBAC bindings<br/>(proxy-role, auth-reviewer)

    Note over User,OTel: Evaluation & Guardrails Flow
    User->>K8sAPI: Create EvalHub CR
    K8sAPI-->>Manager: Watch notification
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Create eval Deployment + Service
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Create ServiceMonitor
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Create Route (per evaluation)
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Create ClusterRoleBinding

    User->>K8sAPI: Create LMEvalJob CR
    K8sAPI-->>Manager: Watch notification
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Create eval Pod + PVC
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Create Kueue Workload

    Note over User,OTel: Guardrails Coordination
    K8sAPI-->>Manager: InferenceService watch event
    Manager->>Manager: GuardrailsOrchestrator<br/>coordinates with model serving

    Note over User,OTel: Observability
    Manager->>OTel: Export traces (OTLP gRPC/HTTP)
    Manager->>OTel: Export metrics (OTLP)
    Note over Manager: Prometheus scrapes<br/>metrics endpoint<br/>(conditional auth)
